  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "8244656",
      "title": "Understanding Prop Drilling & Project Overview",
      "sourceHash": "b4e3918482fff656f6269736b3b5124529503fbda28a736fd09627aaa88c9e94",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.72,
          "end": 2.85,
          "en": "Now, before we'll take a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.85,
          "end": 7.38,
          "en": "at any solutions, let's explore the problem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.38,
          "end": 10.65,
          "en": "because as a React developer you are typically going",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.65,
          "end": 15.03,
          "en": "to build applications that consist of multiple Components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.03,
          "end": 18.96,
          "en": "And the more complex your React app is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.96,
          "end": 22.47,
          "en": "the more Components you will typically use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.47,
          "end": 25.563,
          "en": "And those Components, as you learned, are, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.511,
          "end": 28.38,
          "en": "structured in such a component tree",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.38,
          "end": 32.19,
          "en": "where, for example, the app component might render",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.19,
          "end": 35.73,
          "en": "a Shop and Header component and that those Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.73,
          "end": 37.71,
          "en": "then have other child Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.71,
          "end": 39.723,
          "en": "and other nested Components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.56,
          "end": 44.19,
          "en": "In most apps, you'll not just have, Components though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.19,
          "end": 47.67,
          "en": "but you'll also need to manage some state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.67,
          "end": 50.79,
          "en": "For example, some shopping Cart State",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.79,
          "end": 54.81,
          "en": "if you are building some online shop website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.81,
          "end": 59.52,
          "en": "And in many cases that's state will need to be lifted up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.52,
          "end": 62.94,
          "en": "because, for example, it might be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.94,
          "end": 65.46,
          "en": "and displayed in one component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.46,
          "end": 68.19,
          "en": "in one place of that component tree,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.19,
          "end": 70.32,
          "en": "but it then might be updated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.32,
          "end": 72.27,
          "en": "in a totally different component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.27,
          "end": 75.213,
          "en": "in a different place in that component tree.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.26,
          "end": 79.23,
          "en": "And therefore, as you learned and as you saw",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.23,
          "end": 83.22,
          "en": "in this course already, you often need to manage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 83.22,
          "end": 86.88,
          "en": "the state at some component that has access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.88,
          "end": 89.73,
          "en": "to all Components that need that state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.73,
          "end": 92.94,
          "en": "And you then need to share it through props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.94,
          "end": 96.39,
          "en": "and also update it with help of props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.39,
          "end": 98.28,
          "en": "Props that take functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.28,
          "end": 101.013,
          "en": "which ultimately will edit the state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.50999999999999,
          "end": 105.18,
          "en": "That's what you learned and that's what we saw",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.18,
          "end": 107.34,
          "en": "in many demo projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.34,
          "end": 110.49000000000001,
          "en": "For example, also in that bigger demo project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.49000000000001,
          "end": 112.923,
          "en": "we explored in the previous section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.03,
          "end": 117.15,
          "en": "And as you can see on this chart here already,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.15,
          "end": 119.03999999999999,
          "en": "and as you saw in the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.03999999999999,
          "end": 122.22,
          "en": "of that demo project in the last section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.22,
          "end": 126.36,
          "en": "this often means that you need to pass that shared data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 126.36,
          "end": 128.88,
          "en": "through multiple layers of Components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 128.88,
          "end": 132.153,
          "en": "And that is something that's called prop drilling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 133.23,
          "end": 136.82999999999998,
          "en": "You are passing props through multiple Components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.82999999999998,
          "end": 141.45,
          "en": "even though most Components don't directly need that data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.45,
          "end": 144.513,
          "en": "They just pass it on to some child component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.5,
          "end": 147.87,
          "en": "And that can be a problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 147.87,
          "end": 151.56,
          "en": "because this for one makes your Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 151.56,
          "end": 155.52,
          "en": "a bit less reusable because they always must be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 155.52,
          "end": 159.75,
          "en": "in a place where they can get that shared data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 159.75,
          "end": 161.79,
          "en": "And it also means that you have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.79,
          "end": 165.32999999999998,
          "en": "to write a lot of extra boilerplate code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 165.32999999999998,
          "end": 168.54,
          "en": "because you need to accept and destructure a prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 168.54,
          "end": 172.56,
          "en": "in a component and then forward it to a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 172.56,
          "end": 176.403,
          "en": "just to then maybe repeat that entire process.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 177.27,
          "end": 179.85,
          "en": "And therefore, in this course section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 179.85,
          "end": 183.6,
          "en": "we'll take a look at a couple of possible solutions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 183.6,
          "end": 185.25,
          "en": "for this problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 185.25,
          "end": 187.44,
          "en": "Now, for this course section here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 187.44,
          "end": 190.41,
          "en": "I prepared another brand new project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 190.41,
          "end": 192.39,
          "en": "So you can also follow along",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 192.39,
          "end": 196.11,
          "en": "if you did not go through that previous course section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 196.11,
          "end": 198.96,
          "en": "where we built another demo project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 198.96,
          "end": 202.14,
          "en": "and where whilst building that project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 202.14,
          "end": 205.77,
          "en": "we experienced this prop drilling problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 205.77,
          "end": 207.24,
          "en": "and how annoying it can be.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 207.24,
          "end": 210.12,
          "en": "Here for this section, you got a brand new project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 210.12,
          "end": 213.36,
          "en": "so that you can follow along either way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 213.36,
          "end": 217.5,
          "en": "And in that project we basically got a little online shop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 217.5,
          "end": 221.01,
          "en": "with a shopping cart where we can add products to the cart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 221.01,
          "end": 222.54,
          "en": "and we can then view the cart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 222.54,
          "end": 225.27,
          "en": "And in the cart we can also edit the cart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 225.27,
          "end": 229.14,
          "en": "and update it and also remove products if you want to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 229.14,
          "end": 230.64,
          "en": "And then click checkout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 230.64,
          "end": 232.713,
          "en": "which will just close the cart though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 233.55,
          "end": 235.71,
          "en": "So this is not a full online shop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 235.71,
          "end": 239.1,
          "en": "it's just this shop with the cart functionality.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 239.1,
          "end": 242.43,
          "en": "But for this shop, for this project here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 242.43,
          "end": 244.98,
          "en": "we're already using a couple of Components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 244.98,
          "end": 247.8,
          "en": "which you find in that starting project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 247.8,
          "end": 249.63,
          "en": "which you, of course, find attached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 249.63,
          "end": 253.29,
          "en": "both as a local and a CodeSandbox version.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 253.29,
          "end": 256.83,
          "en": "And here in this project you'll essentially see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 256.83,
          "end": 260.1,
          "en": "that component structure I also showed you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 260.1,
          "end": 262.41,
          "en": "on the slide before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 262.41,
          "end": 264.36,
          "en": "It's essentially the same structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 264.36,
          "end": 266.94,
          "en": "in this demo project I prepared for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 266.94,
          "end": 269.4,
          "en": "And there in this demo project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 269.4,
          "end": 271.77,
          "en": "I'm also managing my shopping cart state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 271.77,
          "end": 275.88,
          "en": "in the App component because it's the App component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 275.88,
          "end": 278.73,
          "en": "that has access to all the Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 278.73,
          "end": 282.213,
          "en": "that needs to interact with that shopping cart state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 283.23,
          "end": 285.75,
          "en": "Therefore, it's also in the app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 285.75,
          "end": 289.74,
          "en": "where I got my state updating logic to update",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 289.74,
          "end": 292.02,
          "en": "the quantity of items in the cart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 292.02,
          "end": 294.87,
          "en": "or add items to the cart for the first time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 294.87,
          "end": 296.973,
          "en": "or remove items from the cart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 298.32,
          "end": 301.11,
          "en": "And then I'm using the Header and the Shop component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 301.11,
          "end": 303.315,
          "en": "here in the App component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 303.315,
          "end": 305.91,
          "en": "and I'm forwarding the cart data and also functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 305.91,
          "end": 309.63,
          "en": "for adding items and updating the cart quantity",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 309.63,
          "end": 314.133,
          "en": "of that cart to the Header and the Shop Components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 315.69,
          "end": 320.22,
          "en": "And then those Components, for example, forward that data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 320.22,
          "end": 322.02,
          "en": "The Header component, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 322.02,
          "end": 326.19,
          "en": "forwards the cart items to the CartModal component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 326.19,
          "end": 328.743,
          "en": "which needs that items to display them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 329.88,
          "end": 333.18,
          "en": "And it's pretty similar in the Shop component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 333.18,
          "end": 336.93,
          "en": "There I also get that card updating function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 336.93,
          "end": 339.87,
          "en": "but I'm just forwarding it to my products here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 339.87,
          "end": 341.90999999999997,
          "en": "which are being output in a list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 341.90999999999997,
          "end": 345.12,
          "en": "I'm not using that updating function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 345.12,
          "end": 346.83,
          "en": "in the Shop component itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 346.83,
          "end": 348.33299999999997,
          "en": "I'm just forwarding it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 349.38,
          "end": 352.56,
          "en": "And that's that prop drilling I mentioned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 352.56,
          "end": 354.45,
          "en": "And now we're going to take a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 354.45,
          "end": 356.64300000000003,
          "en": "at some solutions for that problem.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}